AH AL BH BL  meaning
 0  0  0  0  coast: no driven path (current can only decay)
 0  0  0  1  coast: no driven path (current can only decay)
 0  0  1  0  coast: no driven path (current can only decay)
 0  0  1  1  SHOOT-THROUGH: supply shorted to ground (forbidden)
 0  1  0  0  coast: no driven path (current can only decay)
 0  1  0  1  brake (low side): motor terminals shorted together
 0  1  1  0  reverse: current B -> A through the motor
 0  1  1  1  SHOOT-THROUGH: supply shorted to ground (forbidden)
 1  0  0  0  coast: no driven path (current can only decay)
 1  0  0  1  forward: current A -> B through the motor
 1  0  1  0  brake (high side): motor terminals shorted together
 1  0  1  1  SHOOT-THROUGH: supply shorted to ground (forbidden)
 1  1  0  0  SHOOT-THROUGH: supply shorted to ground (forbidden)
 1  1  0  1  SHOOT-THROUGH: supply shorted to ground (forbidden)
 1  1  1  0  SHOOT-THROUGH: supply shorted to ground (forbidden)
 1  1  1  1  SHOOT-THROUGH: supply shorted to ground (forbidden)
7 of 16 combinations are forbidden
